      "writtenOn": "2021-03-22T13:24:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s fair, I like that word HARDWARE being thrown in. How FEATURE_HARDWARE_KEYSTORE so it matches with FEATURE_STRONGBOX_KEYSTORE?\n\nBut I think we still need to mention KeyMint in the comments (with link to s.a.c) since, uh, we\u0027re conveying the KeyMint version number here.",
      "parentUuid": "1b1714b9_5d17b977",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2183,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2183,
        "endChar": 85
