      "writtenOn": "2021-03-22T14:35:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How would you use the version number if you don\u0027t know what it is? IOW, we need to mention them. New PS coming up using FEATURE_HARDWARE_KEYSTORE and FEATURE_STRONGBOX_KEYSTORE.",
      "parentUuid": "abf9a463_bd3041a7",
