      "writtenOn": "2021-03-22T15:02:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The version numbers will need to be associated with the keystore features that are hardware-supported, but I don\u0027t think we need to mention Keymaster or KeyMint.",
      "parentUuid": "f5e370ff_0582ae81",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2183,
        "startChar": 0,
