      "writtenOn": "2021-03-17T20:31:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, how is this value related to the existing FEATURE_STRONGBOX_KEYSTORE value?\n\nNote that it is reasonable to add a version to an existing feature, so you might be interested in reusing FEATURE_STRONGBOX_KEYSTORE?  (Which might better align with FEATURE_KEYSTORE suggestion above?)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2200,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2200,
        "endChar": 58
