      "writtenOn": "2021-03-18T13:29:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think with the proposed setup, you\u0027d have FEATURE_KEYMINT_STRONGBOX set to a non-empty version if and only if FEATURE_STRONGBOX_KEYSTORE is set to true.\n\nSo if we end up using FEATURE_KEYSTORE instead of FEATURE_KEYMINT it would be great if we can just reuse FEATURE_STRONGBOX_KEYSTORE.",
